<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 20.87 to 6812.72.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.13 to 404.71.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.11.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1330 to 1136.</p>
<p>Volume was 489,240,330 compared with 501,976,130 on Tuesday.</p>
